        {
          "options": ["mi", "mı", "mu"],
          "answer": 0
        }
      ],
      "explain": "Voiceless ç → *-ti*. The ending *-n* stays on the verb and *mi* follows, in harmony with its i: *geçtin mi?*"
    },
